Subject: optimize utils functions for better performance and maintainability
From: Claude Code <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 29 Sep 2025 00:00:00 +0000

Optimize rkmpp_copy_buffer, rkmpp_to_v4l2_buffer, and rkmpp_from_v4l2_buffer
functions to improve performance, reduce code duplication, and enhance
maintainability.

Key improvements:
- Add inline helper functions for common operations (should_copy_plane,
  get_copy_size, get_mpp_offset)
- Simplify control flow in rkmpp_copy_buffer with early returns and
  cleaner memory management
- Improve error handling and logging consistency across all functions
- Reduce code duplication in plane setup and memory type handling
- Add better bounds checking and validation
- Optimize memory mapping operations with consolidated logic

The optimizations maintain full compatibility while making the code more
readable and efficient.

Index: libv4l-rkmpp/src/utils.c
